SUMMARY:International Axe Throwing Championship
DESCRIPTION:The International Axe Throwing Federation will present the 2026 International Axe Throwing Championships\, taking place at locations around Toronto\, ON on May 27-31\, and featuring axe throwers from around the world. \nThe IATF is proud to bring IATC to Toronto for our 10 year anniversary. IATC features the top competitors from across North America\, Europe\, and Australia. Tournaments will take place around Toronto over 5 days culminating in the Wilson Cup finals at Homecoming\, the winner of which will be awarded the eponymous Wilson Cup and a $9\,000 USD cash prize. \nSpectators can attend events from Wednesday through Saturday for free\, venue capacity permitting. Tickets for Sunday are $50 USD and include access to Homecoming\, the ultimate viewing party experience featuring the Axe Market\, outdoor viewing tents\, food trucks\, a photobooth\, full bar\, live bands\, and more!
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/international-axe-throwing-championship/
LOCATION:BATL Grounds | Stock Yards\, 30 Weston Rd\, Toronto\, ON M6N 0A7\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M6N 0A7
CATEGORIES:Sports
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/international-axe-throwing-championship.jpg
END:VEVENT
