SUMMARY:Colour Unbound
DESCRIPTION:Sandra is an abstract artist working in acrylic and oil\, exploring the language of colour\, texture\, and movement. Through layered compositions and expressive mark-making\, her work captures a sense of energy and emotional depth. The Leslie Grove Gallery from May 27-June 7. Gallery hours: Wednesday to Sunday 12-5 PM.  Opening reception will take place on Thursday\, May 28\, 5-8 pm. Details at https://www.artistsnetwork.ca/patrons-calendar.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/colour-unbound/
LOCATION:Leslie Grove Gallery\, 1158 Queen St E\, Toronto\, ON M4M 1L2\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M4M 1L2
CATEGORIES:Art & Design
