SUMMARY:THE SOVEREIGN GALA: GENESIS
DESCRIPTION:About the Event\nTHE SOVEREIGN GALA: GENESIS is not your typical Toronto networking event. This will be the most prestigious event of Toronto Tech Week! Prepare for an evening of elegance\, mystery\, and powerful connections with entrepreneurs\, investors\, founders\, and influential leaders. \nWe are Proud to be an Official Partner of Toronto Tech Week. \nSet in a luxurious black-tie atmosphere\, this masquerade blends elegance with connection. A selection of Gourmet food\, and an Open Bar to share conversations. Behind the masks\, guests  you will meet include some of the most ambitious minds across Tech\, AI\, Real Estate\, Venture Capital\, and Startups. Expect a refined social environment where meaningful conversations\, partnerships\, and new ideas can emerge naturally. \nWhat To Expect\n🍽️ Food Experience \nEnjoy elevated food stations throughout the night: \n• Oven-Baked Custom Pizza Station – Fresh pizzas made to order• Chef-Curated Gourmet Bites served throughout the evening• Artisan Gelato Station with premium flavors• Delicious small plates perfect for mingling and socializing \n🍸 Drinks & Bar \nA premium bar experience designed for the night: \n• Signature Masquerade Cocktails crafted exclusively for the event• Open Bar with premium spirits\, wine\, and beer• Drinks curated by professional mixologists \n🎭 Black & Gold Masquerade \nEnter a stunning black-and-gold themed venue where masks and black-tie attire create an atmosphere of elegance and intrigue.The masquerade setting adds mystery while making conversations more relaxed and memorable. \n💎 GEMSTONE FINANCE PRESENTS \n💍 An Exclusive Gemstone Auction \nBrowse and bid in a silent gemstone auction. featuring a limited collection of unique certified precious gems from the Gemstone Finance vaults. Timeless beauty and value presented in a curated gemstone browsing experience\, and at the end of the night\, they can be yours forever. We will be announcing more specifics as we draw closer to the Gala. \n🎟️ WIN a Precious Gemstone \nEvery attendee will also be entered into a draw to win a Certified Precious Gemstone with an appraised value of over $1000! Details to be announced. \n🥂 Luxury Social Atmosphere \nExpect a vibrant environment with great music by by Rotation Sensation\, great people\, and meaningful conversations\, all designed to spark new ideas\, partnerships\, and opportunities. \n🚐 Luxury Limo Shuttle/Party Bus \nFor a seamless experience\, complimentary limo shuttles will run between Toronto and the venue throughout the night. (Details will be shared with approved guests) \nItinerary\n7:00 PM – 7:30 PM | Arrivals & Check-In \nGuests arrive\, check in\, and step into the black and gold masquerade atmosphere. \nLuxury Limo Shuttle/Party Bus Downtown Toronto Pickup Starts at 7:00pm (Details will be shared with approved guests) \n7:30 PM – 10:30 PM | Party & Social Experience \nEnjoy the best of Toronto Tech Week while enjoying music\, food\, the gemstones on display\, the silent auction and open bar in an elegant setting. \n11:00 PM – 1:00 AM | Final Connections & Closing Moments \nExchange contacts\, continue conversations\, and head out to the after parties! (Official Partner After Parties TBD) \nJoin Us on WhatsApp \nBe part of our growing WhatsApp Community! Continue the conversations\, share information\, and connect with our growing community by clicking here. \nDress Code:\nAn evening of elegance and mystery. Guests are expected to wear formal black tie attire paired with a masquerade mask. \nGentlemen are expected to wear a tuxedo or black formal suit with bow tie. \nLadies are encouraged to wear evening gowns or elegant cocktail dresses. \nMasquerade masks are highly encouraged to embrace the mystery and atmosphere of the evening. \nColors that complement the event aesthetic:Black\, white\, gold\, metallics\, and deep jewel tones. \n🔞 Age Requirement: 19+ \n“Toronto Tech Week is a citywide celebration of the people building what’s next. From May 25–29\, 2026\, founders\, investors\, and builders come together for hundreds of community-led events across Toronto\, connecting tens of thousands of people around Canadian tech. Torontotechweek.com.” \nEVENT SPONSOR:\nTriggerVox – Turn Your Calls and Website Into aSales Machine. Acts as your 24/7 Receptionist (Scheduling\, Q&A\, Customer Support\, FAQ) \nTriggerVox talks to your leads within 30 seconds\, answers questions\, handles objections\, and books appointments so you never miss a sale/client/Customer! \nWhat to Bring\n✅ Your Mask & Black Tie Attire✅ Business Cards or LinkedIn QR Code✅ Friends & Colleagues who would enjoy connecting with Toronto’s most ambitious community (All guests must sign up and be approved)
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/the-sovereign-gala-genesis/
LOCATION:Toronto\, Toronto\, ON\, Canada\, Toronto\, Ontario
CATEGORIES:Community Events,Food & Drink,Nightlife,Science & Tech
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/the-sovereign-gala-genesis.jpg
END:VEVENT
