SUMMARY:SHEIN Toronto Summer Pop-Up
DESCRIPTION:From your beach bag to your dinner look\, and everything in between\, SHEIN has it all under one roof. The Summer Trends pop-up brings together SHEIN’s full multi-category offering\, so shoppers can build out their entire vacation wardrobe without the compromise. Women’s\, men’s\, kids’\, sports\, beauty\, home\, and vacation-ready accessories: one space\, every style\, every budget. \nJoin SHEIN at it’s Summer pop-up from May 28th – 31st\, 2026 to shop your next summer look! \n\nThursday\, May 28: 10:00 AM – 9:00 PM\nFriday\, May 29: 10:00 AM – 9:00 PM\nSaturday\, May 30: 10:00 AM – 9:00 PM\nSunday\, May 31: 11:00 AM – 7:00 PM\n\nExpect to see Vacation Trends\, bringing to life a playful and expressive mix of aesthetics that capture different travel moods and destinations. From bold\, statement-making looks to soft\, romantic styling\, the space will showcase a range of trend directions\, including Sunset Siren\, Meadow Girl\, Euro Girl Summer\, Coastal Chic\, Whimsical Garden\, and Tropic Girly Pop.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/shein-toronto-summer-pop-up/
LOCATION:341 Queen Street West\, 341 Queen Street West\, Toronto\, Ontario\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Fashion,Markets
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=application/pdf:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Invitation-Graphic.pdf
END:VEVENT
