SUMMARY:FASHION ART TORONTO FASHION WEEK — MAIN HUB AT T3 BAYSIDE
DESCRIPTION:Fashion Art Toronto returns this May with its main Fashion Week hub at T3 Bayside — a high-energy\, multi-day takeover showcasing 50+ designers and artists. Across four nights of runway shows\, the space transforms into an immersive fashion playground\, featuring standout presentations from both emerging and established talent. \nBeyond the runway\, the experience unfolds through shopping\, installations\, red carpet moments\, interactive art\, and curated photo opportunities — all set within a vibrant mix of bars\, lounges\, and social spaces from day to night. As part of a full week of city-wide programming\, T3 Bayside anchors the experience as the epicentre of Toronto’s fashion energy.
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/fashion-art-toronto-fashion-week-main-hub-at-t3-bayside/
LOCATION:T3 Bayside\, 251 Queens Quay E\, Toronto\, ON M5A 0X3\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5A 0X3
CATEGORIES:2SLGBTQ+,Art & Design,Exhibitions,Fashion
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/fashion-art-toronto-fashion-week-main-hub-at-t3-bayside.jpg
