SUMMARY:Steak Omakase Dinner Experience
DESCRIPTION:After a sold-out debut\, Maxime’s steak omakase experience is back for one night only\, in collaboration with Woodward Meats\, a leader in Toronto’s fine butchery. \nEnjoy a guided tasting of rare and globally sourced cuts presented by Dale McMenemy\, one of Canada’s foremost voices in premium butchery\, offering insight into the craft and provenance of each selection. \nDinner Details🗓️ Thursday\, May 28\, 2026 📍 Maxime’s (77 Portland St.) \nMenu Details🥩 The Connoisseur • $130 per person choice of appetizer\, steak omakase featuring 3 premium cuts (3oz of each)\, choice of side \n🥩 The Grand Tour • $180 per person choice of appetizer\, steak omakase featuring 4 premium cuts (3oz of each)\, choice of side \nWine pairing available upon request.  \nMenu \nAPPETIZER choice of one \nOysters (3pc)mignonette\, lemon\, horseradish \nMediterranean Saladbarrel-aged Greek feta\, iceberg lettuce\, cucumber\, olives\, dill vinaigrette \nMAIN \nThe Connoisseur《 3 CUT 》Beef Hanger Wagyu | nature-led\, westholme\, northern australiaAustralian New York Strip | nature-led\, westholme\, northern australiaOakleigh Ranch Wagyu | tajima bloodline\, central queensland\, australia \nThe Grand Tour《 4 CUT 》  includes cuts above\, plusA5 Wagyu | japanese black cattle\, miyazaki prefecture\, japan \nSIDE choice of one \nHouse Cut Friessea salt\, tarragon aioli \nCream Spinachyuzu kosho\, onion\, lemon breadcrumbs \nCorn Succotashjalapeño\, tomato\, parmesan\, basil
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/steak-omakase-dinner-experience/
LOCATION:Maxime’s Steakhouse Toronto\, 77 Portland St\, Toronto\, ON M5V 2M9\, Canada\, Old Toronto\, Toronto\, Ontario\, M5V 2M9
CATEGORIES:Food & Drink
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://nowtoronto.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/steak-omakase-dinner-experience.png
END:VEVENT
