SUMMARY:Toronto Professional Singles Speed Dating II
DESCRIPTION:In a world of endless swiping\, it’s never been harder to truly meet people. Step away from the apps and into real connection.\nJoin Single in the City for a curated Speed Dating experience designed for ambitious singles who value their time. \nMeet up to 15 local singles face-to-face in a series of relaxed\, low-pressure conversations. \nBecause the right connection doesn’t happen on a screen. \nInclusions:\n\nUp to 15 Dates.\nAppetizers\n\nSign in Begins at 7:00pm / Dating at 7:15pm
URL:https://nowtoronto.com/event/toronto-professional-singles-speed-dating-ii/
